## Architecture

- **Angular 21** standalone architecture (no NgModules)
- **Ionic** for native-like UI components
- **Capacitor** for native platform access (Android/iOS)
- **Component prefix**: `{{ model.manifest.component_prefix }}`
- **Styling**: SCSS with Ionic theme variables and CSS custom properties
- **Routing**: Lazy-loaded feature routes with auth guards
- **HTTP**: Interceptor-based auth and error handling
- **Error handling**: Global ErrorHandler with structured logging

